    <string name="incomplete_daily_evidence_standard">≥ marks the minimum confirmed by captures so far on an unfinished day.\n? means the available captures cannot constrain that day.\n≈ marks a Monday-first 90/50/0 estimate among all arrangements compatible with every captured Weekly Merit counter and recent-login time; the actual daily placement may differ.\nA recent login proves the 50-point login merit. A Daily Patrol supply event proves that member reached 90 points, but its absence does not prove that Daily Patrol was missed.\nIf the skipped period is excessively long, all earlier history may be displayed as ?.</string>
    <string name="incomplete_daily_evidence_gunsmoke">≥ marks a minimum confirmed by login or Daily Patrol evidence.\n? means the available captures cannot safely separate that day.\nMissing Gunsmoke days cannot be safely divided into merit, score, attempts, login, or Daily Patrol; use the counter-backed Total and manually correct only facts you know.\nA recent login proves attendance, and a Daily Patrol supply event proves Daily Patrol for that member only.\nIf the skipped period is excessively long, all earlier history may be displayed as ?.</string>
